e historical pact led by  presidential candidate gustavo petro who  has a 15 percent advantage over his  closest rival their victory would  represent a seismic shift  for the first time there's a real  possibility that candidacies that don't  come from traditional liberal or  political elites could win the  presidency and control congress and this  generates turbulence a latent political  crisis  beating those who believe the time for  change has come against others who fear  it would be a dangerous leap into the  dark alessandra  al jazeera kali
 

